AutoFlow 1.1.3
• Android can now read the screen: pixel checks, waiting for a colour, scene matching, finding a reference image and on-screen text (OCR), after you grant screen-capture consent
• Stop also cancels a long press or drag in progress
• OCR runs on-device via Google Play services (Latin, Korean, Japanese, Chinese)
• The Accessibility service is explained in the app, in 12 languages, before Settings opens
